{# ===========================================================================
   Component: starburst

   The badge from the October 2025 brand guidelines, page 18: red fill, white
   stroke, white brush type, two lines, overlapping the edge of the band it
   sits on. In the guidelines it reads OPEN DAILY and SPECIALS DAILY.

   USAGE
     {% set burstTop = "Open" %}
     {% set burstBottom = "Daily" %}
     {% include "components/starburst.njk" %}

   SCOPED TO /happy-hour/. DESIGN_SYSTEM.md permits the page 18 promotional
   devices on the promotional page and nowhere else. Do not carry this onto a
   location page or the home page without a decision.

   THE COPY MUST BE A FACT. This is a graphic that reads as a claim, which is
   the most dangerous kind of decoration on this project. "Open daily" is
   published because it is now true and confirmed: the hours Connor supplied
   on 2026-09-09 cover all seven days at all six San Diego rooms. It is not
   borrowed from the guidelines because it looked good there.

   The shape is decorative and hidden from assistive technology; the words are
   real text on top of it, so they are read, selected, translated and scaled
   like any other type rather than being trapped in an image.
   =========================================================================== #}
<span class="burst" role="img" aria-label="{{ burstTop }} {{ burstBottom }}">
